  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-service-area-analysis.\n\n- Computes facility service areas (isochrones) using multi-source Dijkstra over a network graph.\n- Supports multi-facility overlay, nearest-facility assignment, and multi-threshold coverage statistics.\n- Can run in fully offline mode and includes synthetic data generation for testing.\n- Outputs service areas in GeoJSON or JSON format, with stats and manifest files.\n- No external data or network requests required; all processing is done locally.\n- MIT licensed.",
